A.aIt=new B.hd("Kbook - Korean book","A Korean language learning app that features over 1000 short webtoon-style comics created by amateur authors. KBOOK supports aspiring writers by providing a publishing platform and was selected as one of the top 3 nationwide apps in 2023, receiving government support and partnering with 120 authors. Promotes Korean language and culture through creative content.","assets/images/image_kbook.webp",A.aBc,"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/kbook-korean-book/id1643541530",null,null,"iOS")
